	(text "OVP nominal = 28.690 V; U2 must be TLV3011B (POR + fail-safe + internal hysteresis).\nPOR may leave OUT Hi-Z for up to 1.9 ms. Hold PWM LOW through rail transitions; wait >=5 ms after rails valid.\nTPS61165 CTRL filter = 180 us; shutdown LOW >2.5 ms. Target PWM 20 kHz; R13=8.2k limits ACK current.\nFH26 family is rated 30 V: verify open-load peaks <30 V. OVP is NOT a hard clamp; see engineering report."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 16 262 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "14dc896d-d5aa-4aec-829d-3dbdc945f14e")
	)
	(text "LED load: 21.6-27.2 V at 40 mA  |  Separate regulated boost supply  |  Common GND with F469"
